<p><strong>Why this works:</strong> Adding Turpan and Urumqi to the 7-day Gansu itinerary gives you a taste of Xinjiang's unique Uyghur culture, desert landscapes, and ancient oasis cities. The high-speed train between Turpan and Urumqi (1 hour) makes this connection easy. You'll experience the contrast between Han Chinese culture in the east and Turkic/Muslim culture in the west — the essence of the Silk Road.</p>

